  "ruleText": "Par 210.09 Decisions. In accordance with RSA 651-A:3 II, a panel of 3 board members, including the presiding officer, shall make a decision after personally hearing the testimony in the case.\n\nSource. #7149, eff 12-7-99, EXPIRED: 12-7-07\n\nNew. #9070, INTERIM, eff 1-11-08, EXPIRED: 7-9-08\n\nNew. #9254, eff 9-6-08; ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17",
